ore_item_assets/steam/apps/3214340/extras/8d55a3b4c33ba6a176a3502de5cc63fd.mp4?t=1773169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the Temple and face its challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here the game starts properly. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control both characters simultaneously in order to solve the puzzles in each room and proceed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the keys and reach the &quot;Boss&quot; Room.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the foxes and traps or use them to your advantage!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214340/extras/e062f59be730b83932b603a9e7567f63.poster.avif?t=1773169934\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214340/extras/e062f59be730b83932b603a9e7567f63.webm?t=1773169934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214340/extras/e062f59be730b83932b603a9e7567f63.mp4?t=1773169934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run away!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you finally face the boss, it's time to escape! Use all the mechanics learned during the level and apply them with a time constraint as Illapa tries to catch up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214340/extras/4445e1b587c2051bd314069fb08be3c7.poster.avif?t=1773169934\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214340/extras/4445e1b587c2051bd314069fb08be3c7.webm?t=1773169934\" type=\"video/webm; 